{"type":"standard","title":"Lower Chehalis language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lower Chehalis language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q6693377","titles":{"canonical":"Lower_Chehalis_language","normalized":"Lower Chehalis language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lower Chehalis language</span></span>"},"pageid":35159608,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1325425778","tid":"63f4d3ba-cfe3-11f0-8ab5-4a0169d84007","timestamp":"2025-12-03T00:59:59Z","description":"Salishan language of North America","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_Chehalis_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_Chehalis_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_Chehalis_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lower_Chehalis_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_Chehalis_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Lower_Chehalis_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lower_Chehalis_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lower_Chehalis_language"}},"extract":"Lower Chehalis (Łəw̓ál̕məš) is a member of the Tsamosan branch of the Coast Salish family of Salishan languages. In some classifications, Lower Chehalis is placed closer to Quinault than it is to Upper Chehalis. It went extinct in the 1990s.","extract_html":"<p><b>Lower Chehalis</b> (Łəw̓ál̕məš) is a member of the Tsamosan branch of the Coast Salish family of Salishan languages. In some classifications, Lower Chehalis is placed closer to Quinault than it is to Upper Chehalis. It went extinct in the 1990s.</p>"}